7. Please verify under penalty of perjury that you know and understand that certain clauses in a contract of adhesion, such as a so-called forum selection clause, are unenforceable unless the party to whom the contract is extended could have rejected the clause without impunity.

8. Please verify under penalty of perjury that you know and understand that rental agreements contracts are a series of continuing offers to contract and as such are nontransferable.

9. Please verify that you know and understand that contacting me again after receipt of this notice without providing procedurally proper validation of the alleged debt may constitute MAIL FRAUD and a complaint will be filed with the U.S. Postal Inspection Service and the F.T.C. pursuant to applicable law and any litigation that ensues will name you in your personal capacity as defendant. 

At this time, I will also inform you that since your offices had reported invalidated information to all the 3 major Credit Bureaus ( XXXX, XXXX, or TransUnion ) this action does constitute fraud under both Federal and State Laws. Y this action, your organization has violated me and my privacy under the following. 
Violation of the Fair Credit Reporting Act Violation of the Fair Debt Collection Practices Act Defamation of Character If your office can provide the proper documentation as requested in this Declaration within 15 calendar days from the date on this letter, I will require at least 30 days from receipt, to investigate this information and during such time all collection activity must cease and desist. Until this account is validated, please remove this alleged account from all three credit reporting agencies ( XXXX, XXXX, and TransUnion ). 

As an act of good faith, I am extending you thirty ( 15 ) days from the receipt of this notice to perform in compliance with the requested demands. If your office fails to respond to this validation request within 15 days from the date of your receipt, all references to this account must be deleted and completely removed from my credit file and a copy of such deletion request shall be sent to me immediately. Your failure to perform will involve the legal concepts of acquiescence and admission whereby the alleged debt is admittedly invalid and thereby repudiated in its entirety. In the interim you are prohibited from any contact with the undersigned except in writing and only regarding the matter herein expressed. 

